sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor ST as Student
  actor AS as Academic Supervisor
  participant PWA as React PWA
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant AI as Similarity service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  ST->>PWA: Fill weekly report,<br/>attach ≤ 3 files
  PWA->>API: POST /report-slots/{id}/submit
  API->>API: Check owner, slot<br/>open, files valid
  API->>DB: One transaction: save version + files,<br/>status = Submitted, Late flag if<br/>server time > due_at, audit entry
  API-->>PWA: 201 Created<br/>(On time or Late)
  API-)AI: Background task:<br/>check similarity
  AI->>DB: Compare with stored reports of the<br/>same university (except own earlier versions)
  opt Score ≥ threshold (default 30 %)
    AI->>DB: Create flag with<br/>matching passages
  end
  API-)AS: Notify "report submitted"<br/>(in-app + email)

  AS->>PWA: Open report
  PWA->>API: GET /report-slots/{id}
  API-->>PWA: Report, versions, comments,<br/>similarity flag
  alt Accept
    AS->>PWA: Accept
    PWA->>API: POST /report-slots/{id}/accept
    API->>DB: Status = Accepted,<br/>audit entry
  else Request revision
    AS->>PWA: Request revision +<br/>comment (required)
    PWA->>API: POST /report-slots/{id}/revision
    API->>DB: Status = Revision<br/>Requested, audit entry
    API-)ST: Notify student<br/>with the comment
  end
  Note over AS,DB: A similarity flag is advisory: it never changes the status by itself (FR-SIM-03)
